Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.99,0:02:00.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN G]\NCome on.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just apologize already!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.93,0:02:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN FF]\NDon't you have\Nsomething you wanna live for?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.83,0:02:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NHeh.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.68,0:02:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, kid? What'cha thinkin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.70,0:02:12.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You screwed up and\Nnow it's time to pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.27,0:02:13.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, speak up.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.84,0:02:16.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please! Take a look at that brat.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Obviously you scared\Nhim silent, Captain!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.78,0:02:19.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE NAMI laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't blame the kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.34,0:02:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After that guy with the schnoz
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.84,0:02:25.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and that chick with the long\Nhair picked a fight with us,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we're in a worse mood than usual.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.35,0:02:32.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, if you don't wanna be our personal\Npunching bag, you'd best ask forgiveness.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.32,0:02:34.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kneel! Get down in the dirt!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.33,0:02:35.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget your pride.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.67,0:02:39.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you're gonna end up throwin'\Nyour life away over some small mistake.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.66,0:02:43.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, our captain's trigger\Nfinger can be a little twitchy.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.08,0:02:46.45,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.45,0:02:47.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN H]\NC'mon, kid, just do it!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.95,0:02:50.72,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't mess around\Nwith Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.72,0:02:53.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN I]\NYou're gonna die if\Nyou don't do what he says!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.40,0:02:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NAll right, look. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.57,0:02:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now I got somewhere to be.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.98,0:03:01.88,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[ALL]\N– What's wrong with you?\N– What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.88,0:03:11.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bad move. Say goodbye, punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.59,0:03:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[WOMAN C screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.36,0:03:45.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ALL gasping]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.09,0:03:46.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN GG]\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.19,0:03:53.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MAN HH]\NHey. That guy... Did he do somethin'?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.15,0:04:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why you bein' such an ass about this?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.32,0:04:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just wanna go fish.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, too bad, you can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.05,0:04:05.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NGive me one good reason!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:05.59,0:04:09.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it, give me one good\Nreason why I should even listen to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.16,0:04:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna hang out together any more\Nthan you do, but I can't let you get lost!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.31,0:04:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.67,0:04:17.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nothing would make me happier\Nthan leaving you here for good.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.57,0:04:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.80,0:04:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The point is, everyone's\Nmeeting on the ship,
Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.87,0:04:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so you don't get to go\Nfishing on your own!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.49,0:04:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NTch.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.89,0:04:26.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.43,0:04:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.39,0:04:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Number seven thinks he can talk crap\Nto number one and get away with it.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.26,0:04:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think you're better than me\Njust 'cause you got here first?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.17,0:04:38.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like everyone swam\Nto Sabaody, all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got nothin' to brag about!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:41.01,0:04:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, whatever you say, number seven.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fine! You wanna fight me?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.81,0:04:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I trained these legs on the\Nshores of hell for two years!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.42,0:04:53.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NThen you better use them to run.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.15,0:04:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause I will cut you in half!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:54.79,0:04:58.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO, SANJI yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.22,0:05:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.73,0:05:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NAw, man, you okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NUgh. Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.86,0:05:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NLuffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.60,0:05:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I missed you guys so much!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.70,0:05:13.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.17,0:05:14.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.47,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.47,0:05:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NFranky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:17.54,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE FRANKY]\NEh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.47,0:05:19.34,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.64,0:05:22.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.88,0:05:25.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSniper King?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:25.45,0:05:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:27.78,0:05:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, wow, you sure changed\Na lot in two years, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet you're all super strong now!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're the Straw Hats up to?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.53,0:05:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're just sitting.\NDid something happen?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.10,0:05:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, but keep it down.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're pissed off, so\Ndon't look 'em in the eye.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't wanna pick\Na fight with these guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.74,0:05:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.67,0:05:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh? What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.46,0:05:50.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NWhoa, what happened, boss?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.41,0:05:53.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was messed up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like, all of a sudden,\NI got these chills!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NNever seen a trick like that before!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.82,0:06:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I forgot. We got another\Nproblem, actually.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.06,0:06:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The thing is, Cocoa...uh, I mean,\NRobin is in a real pickle right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.46,0:06:10.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NShe was kidnapped?!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you let the bastards go?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.99,0:06:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry. I mean,\Nit all happened so fast.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:16.50,0:06:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They must be human traffickers!\NThis could be real bad!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.33,0:06:21.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They could try to sell her at auction!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.07,0:06:23.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like what happened with Camie!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.21,0:06:26.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a good look at them?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.78,0:06:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NNo. Like I said,\Nit happened all sudden-like.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.68,0:06:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Hey, Captain, they musta nabbed Cocoa\N'cause they thought she was the real Robin.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.45,0:06:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We might be in over our heads here.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.16,0:06:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shoulda known. You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.24,0:06:41.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She does look just like the real thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.54,0:06:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess that worked against us this time.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.98,0:06:47.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Are you keeping secrets from me?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.25,0:06:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.99,0:06:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't care. Leave her!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.23,0:06:54.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not our problem if she dies.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.77,0:06:55.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NWhat? Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.85,0:06:56.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.82,0:07:01.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts? Luffy,\NRobin is our friend!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.04,0:07:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, what is this thing?\NAnd why does it talk?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.53,0:07:08.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this is supposed to be\Na joke, it's not funny!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We lost Robin once...\Ndon't kid about that!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:10.61,0:07:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See, it's doing it again!\NIt can't be a toy.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.47,0:07:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NTake it back, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.97,0:07:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get offa me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.26,0:07:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, screw the thing with Robin
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.93,0:07:23.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and screw this stuffed animal thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.53,0:07:28.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta get our whole team together\Nhere on Grove 46, and pronto!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:28.55,0:07:30.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That punk with the long nose.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.61,0:07:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That woman with the orange hair.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.78,0:07:35.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that crappy kid\Nwith the giant backpack.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.34,0:07:39.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hunt them down and kick their asses.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.05,0:07:43.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna show the whole damn world what\Nhappens when you cross Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.74,0:07:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}[BOTH]\N– Uh, roger!\N– Uh, roger!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.18,0:07:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't kill 'em yet, so we can make\Na good show of it, huh, Captain?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:48.90,0:07:53.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll drag 'em through the streets till\Neveryone on Sabaody's shaking in fear!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Works for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.41,0:07:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! It's only been two years!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.71,0:08:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to you? This is wrong!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.65,0:08:03.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I'm just...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.48,0:08:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so sad right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.27,0:08:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're making me cry!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.43,0:08:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the last time,\Nwhat is this stupid thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.55,0:08:12.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAnd none of you wanna help Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.65,0:08:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody's gonna say anything?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.65,0:08:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's this runt so\Nattached to us, anyway?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.22,0:08:19.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When we're done here,\Nmaybe we should try selling it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.79,0:08:21.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NDamn it, forget this!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.46,0:08:23.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to argue with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.63,0:08:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll save her on my own!\NI don't need you!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.33,0:08:34.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NI'm coming, Robin! Hold on!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.23,0:08:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that? They have a fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.63,0:08:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno. But it's definitely them.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.84,0:08:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, they haven't aged\Nwell in the past two years,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.01,0:08:49.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but nobody else has\Na weird pet like that.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the reports\Nare true after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.95,0:08:56.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're alive. The Straw Hats are back!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.52,0:08:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they're causing trouble again!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.20,0:09:01.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Grove #47.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.05,0:09:05.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's them. We've sighted six\NStraw Hats and their pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}{\q2}[MARINA B]\NThe rumors that they recruited other\Npirates seem to be true as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.73,0:09:17.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}{\q2}They should be assembling on\NGrove #46 any minute now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.11,0:09:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood! Then we'd\Nbetter move quickly.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.95,0:09:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the locals before\Nthis becomes a war zone!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.45,0:09:23.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NRoger!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.62,0:09:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pirates are gathering at Grove 46.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.65,0:09:27.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our targets are the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.66,0:09:29.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll engage them in the lawless zone.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They may have reinforcements!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.33,0:09:32.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Block all routes of escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:32.96,0:09:36.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Close in on them from\NGroves 40, 42, and 44!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.51,0:09:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make it snappy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.05,0:09:40.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,G1 is sending in backup now!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.35,0:09:49.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE G]\NSentomaru, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.14,0:09:51.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm heading in first.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.35,0:09:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,PX-5 and PX-7 will accompany me.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.11,0:09:59.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE G]\NWhoa. You're deploying Pacifistas, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.62,0:10:01.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NOf course I am!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You fools.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.48,0:10:08.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haven't you learned not to\Nunderestimate the Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.00,0:10:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been two years since the war.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.37,0:10:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surely they've only grown\Nstronger during that time.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.48,0:10:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They may be rookies, but make no mistake,\Nthey're the most dangerous pirates here.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.98,0:10:24.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NAs for what happened last time,\Nwe were never able to determine
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.77,0:10:28.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,why Kuma sent them away instead\Nof apprehending them.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.51,0:10:34.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NBut even after his personality was\Nwiped, his actions seemed to indicate
Dialogue: 50,0:10:34.85,0:10:37.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that they would be\Nreturning here someday.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.18,0:10:40.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now that they have, we must\Nensure that this doesn't end
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.79,0:10:42.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,like it did two years ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.59,0:10:44.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's move!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.26,0:11:09.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Damn it! Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:09.50,0:11:11.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NNone of this makes sense!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.03,0:11:16.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are they acting that way?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.80,0:11:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Zoro, Nami, Sanji, Franky.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:22.48,0:11:25.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to them? Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.40,0:11:29.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin gets taken away,\Nand you don't care?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:31.81,0:11:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.16,0:11:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've been working so hard these past\Ntwo years to be a better doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:39.29,0:11:40.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But for what?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.58,0:11:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NChopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.49,0:11:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:51.04,0:11:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYoo-hoo! Over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.77,0:11:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could tell it was you\Nfrom a mile away!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.24,0:11:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NAh!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Usopp!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.96,0:12:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NJeez, you got so big! Just look at you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.10,0:12:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet I could even ride\Non your back, couldn't I?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.94,0:12:08.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You doin' okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.28,0:12:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.70,0:12:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So cuddly! I'm sure the lady\Nreindeers just adore you!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.44,0:12:17.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I missed you, Chopper. So much!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.99,0:12:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.07,0:12:22.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.59,0:12:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.01,0:12:29.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you guys and all,\Nbut now's not the time for this.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,750)}Robin is in serious trouble!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.31,0:12:39.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? They're just pretending to be you?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.57,0:12:42.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why there's two Namis?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.10,0:12:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.44,0:12:45.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Use your head, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.14,0:12:48.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin was able to avoid\Nthe government for 20 years.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.74,0:12:52.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you really think someone could\Njust grab her and stuff her in a bag?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.09,0:12:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No offense, but come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.69,0:12:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:54.66,0:12:59.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have a tough time telling humans apart,\Nbut she didn't even smell right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:00.50,0:13:01.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.53,0:13:03.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Darn it, now I'm starting to get mad!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.77,0:13:07.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we see one of them again, I'm gonna\Npunch 'em in their big, fake face!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.81,0:13:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've got some nerve,\Npretending to be us!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.68,0:13:13.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, why would they do\Nthat in the first place?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.37,0:13:15.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.13,0:13:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost like we're\Ncelebrities or something.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.67,0:13:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.37,0:13:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let it go to your head.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.71,0:13:25.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Although you aren't that far off, since\Nour captain worked up quite a reputation
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.67,0:13:27.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for fighting in that war.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.27,0:13:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHah. I have to\Ncome up with a cool autograph.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.12,0:13:32.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHeh. I've already got one!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.46,0:13:36.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NCome on, you two, we're famous\Ncriminals, not celebrities.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.07,0:13:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NChopper! Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.92,0:13:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NCome back!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.99,0:13:48.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NUgh. This sucks!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.91,0:13:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That little dude was\Ntheir pet for real!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.98,0:13:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He, like, doubled our credibility!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.65,0:13:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, my side hurts.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.49,0:13:58.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(475,0)}Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:58.05,0:14:00.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That talking stuffed\Nanimal thing was part
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.16,0:14:02.99,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,of the real Straw Hats\Nand you let it get away?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.99,0:14:04.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.83,0:14:06.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And why aren't you looking for it?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.93,0:14:08.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(750,1300,1,\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HFEFEFE&\4c&HFEFEFE&)}[FAKE SANJI, FAKE ZORO whimper]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:08.66,0:14:10.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, go look for him.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.07,0:14:11.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like we have any idea where he went!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.97,0:14:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, Sabaody is super\Nbig and that guy was teeny tiny.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.53,0:14:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't do this. I am dyin' here!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.55,0:14:25.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget runnin'. We'll walk. Power walk.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.41,0:14:27.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hancock was right.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.64,0:14:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With all the pirates around,\Nthis mustache is pretty handy.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.75,0:14:33.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna fight with\Nthose guys anyway.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NLook! It's that kid with the backpack!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.87,0:14:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe our luck ain't so bad after all!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.54,0:14:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NBoss called him a "kid,"
Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.71,0:14:45.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but he kinda looks like\Nan old man to me.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:45.25,0:14:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.69,0:14:52.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, friend. We need\Nyou to come with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.49,0:14:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do this nice and quiet, okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:54.56,0:14:56.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NYou really pissed\Noff our captain, kiddo.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.47,0:15:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd prepare for the worst if I was you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.70,0:15:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You so scared\Nyou can't even talk?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.31,0:15:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji. How's it goin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:07.51,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.51,0:15:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Zoro, too. Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.21,0:15:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, huh, guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.28,0:15:14.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NOh. Uh-huh! Too long, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.62,0:15:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, let's get goin' then. Heh.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.88,0:15:20.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean the rest of\Nthe crew's here already?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.05,0:15:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was so late!\NGood thing you found me!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.81,0:15:31.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, he knows the Straw Hats,\Nbut we don't know him.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.21,0:15:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I care!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.90,0:15:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just take him to Luffy\Nand he'll sort this out!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C]\NReporting from Grove 46.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.74,0:15:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All the new recruits the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.21,0:15:56.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,picked up are gathering here,\Nand from the looks of things,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd say there might be\Nnearly a hundred of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.65,0:16:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Most of them are nobodies,\Nbut there are four captains at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.15,0:16:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see "Gashed" Albion for one.\NHe's worth 92 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.09,0:16:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then there's "Lip-Service" Doughty,\Nwho's worth 88 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.09,0:16:15.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But those aren't the ones\NI'm really worried about.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.43,0:16:19.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They've also got "Wet-Haired"\NCaribou, worth 210 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.43,0:16:22.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The captain of his crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.70,0:16:26.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He brought his brother with him,\N"Blood Splatter" Coribou.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.27,0:16:29.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His bounty's at 190 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.59,0:16:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The Navy is here? So they know.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.50,0:16:54.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Very well, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.56,0:16:56.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it easy! No pushing!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}One more song, Soul King!\NWe're waiting for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.74,0:17:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still need a moment more.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.71,0:17:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My fans are calling for an encore,\Nyou see, and I can't let them down.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.06,0:17:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I owe them this much at least.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.23,0:17:14.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So please, wait up for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.60,0:17:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FANS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those cheers could bring a dead\Nman back from his grave, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,0)}{\i1}[MARINE B]\NThis is the Navy! Nobody move!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the deal? That's not cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.98,0:17:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B]\NThis is last living member of the Rumbar\NPirates, the "Humming Swordsman" Brook,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.08,0:17:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,presumed dead until now,\Nwith a bounty of 33 million.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.76,0:17:57.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Despite his skeletal state, our reports\Nindicate that Soul King is this pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.50,0:18:01.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In addition to his previous crimes,\Nwe have further information that indicates
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.13,0:18:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he is now working for Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.12,0:18:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Soul King Brook, or rather, Humming Swordsman\NBrook, you're under arrest for piracy!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.57,0:18:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FAN F]\NNo, it can't be true!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.67,0:18:18.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I feel like my whole life is a lie.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.17,0:18:19.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FAN M]\NHe was a pirate all along?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.74,0:18:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FAN N]\NBut wait, Straw Hat Luffy's\Nbeen missing for years now.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.48,0:18:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LONGARM BOSS]\NIt's been a good\Nrun, Brook, but it's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.67,0:18:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your betrayal's not exactly\Na surprise, Mr. Manager.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.14,0:18:35.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the one to blame, telling me you\Nwere gonna retire right after the show.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you do this to me?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:37.11,0:18:39.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pity, but it seems like\NI would've been better off
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.52,0:18:42.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,keeping you in that cage after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.39,0:18:45.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were gonna be rich,\Nbut now our company's ruined.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a filthy traitor.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.38,0:18:54.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LONGARM BOSS]\NIf my life's going to hell,\NI'm taking you with me.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.85,0:18:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[CHOPPER]\NThat is so cool!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.90,0:19:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.67,0:19:06.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I get a body like that, too?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.08,0:19:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSo, can you, like, transform and stuff?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.95,0:19:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot beams? Missiles? Laser eyes?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.28,0:19:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Show me! Show me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:20.18,0:19:21.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY]\NI carry the dreams of men
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.42,0:19:23.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,on my massive, metal shoulders!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.75,0:19:26.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]\NI'm back and better than ever!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.86,0:19:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm not just me...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.59,0:19:33.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm armored me, baby!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NRobot! Robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.43,0:19:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know he's cool! But stop\Nbefore you have a heart attack!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:42.61,0:19:44.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One thing's buggin' me, though.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.11,0:19:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those giant robo-hands\Nare great for bashing,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but how're you supposed\Nto do detail work?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.47,0:19:51.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Never doubt the master.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.91,0:19:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Dude!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.43,0:19:56.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's got a hand in his hand!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:55.48,0:19:57.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP, CHOPPER yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.23,0:19:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NAMI]\NRobin!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.68,0:19:59.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.49,0:20:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wow, he looks terrible.\NDid he do that to himself?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.95,0:20:12.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN]\NHeh. It's Franky. Don't ask.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.20,0:20:16.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NWhoa, this must\Nbe the coating, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna see somethin'\Nelse cool? Press my nose.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.44,0:20:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your nose?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.59,0:20:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Press and hold it,\Nfor three seconds or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}Apply pressure to the\Nnasal region, human.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.46,0:20:29.90,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHoly crap, he's like a real robot!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.90,0:20:32.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NExcited...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.30,0:20:35.75,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NOne. Two. Three.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NWhoa! He grew hair!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.48,0:20:40.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec. Can you style it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.23,0:20:45.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahh. Easy as pie!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.45,0:20:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:46.59,0:20:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Look who it is! What's up?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I see you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.46,0:20:56.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ugh. Like our crew didn't\Nstick out enough already.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:56.17,0:20:58.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I see your new\Nweapons, please? Can I?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.90,0:21:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.91,0:21:07.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Sorry, buddy, that's the main event,\Nso we gotta wait till the captain shows up.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.17,0:21:07.97,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Mecha.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.97,0:21:09.34,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NHe made robot noises!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.34,0:21:11.17,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NIs "mecha" his new catchphrase?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.17,0:21:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER, USOPP squealing]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:13.98,0:21:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NHello there!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rayleigh! Hey, Shakky!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.10,0:21:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt your reunion,\Nbut we've kinda got an incident.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.71,0:21:24.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Actually, two very large incidents\Nthat demand your attention.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put the guitar down now!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.26,0:21:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hands in the air, pirate!\NThere's no escape!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NMembers of the band...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My lovely chorus...
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.73,0:21:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This will be my final song.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.07,0:21:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will you share it with me?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.31,0:21:44.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[guitar plays]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.48,0:21:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have no fear.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.19,0:21:50.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My music has more than just\Nsoul, it has true power.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.03,0:21:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.83,0:21:54.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You think anyone's gonna\Nlet you play another song?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.37,0:21:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NYou might not see it this way, but I'm\Ngrateful for the time we spent together.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:58.98,0:22:02.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you for these past two years,\Nand thank you for bringing me here.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.58,0:22:05.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My crew and I have rather\Ntragic memories of this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:07.15,0:22:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We lost an important battle here last\Ntime, but we're ready to start anew.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.32,0:22:14.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the musician of the crew.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:14.08,0:22:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I may possess some strength\Nas a swordsman,
Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.18,0:22:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but my job is to make\Nour journey more fun.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.99,0:22:21.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've heard the stories.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.90,0:22:25.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They think people are foolish enough\Nto believe that Straw Hat is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:28.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, you listen to me. He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.47,0:22:31.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Straw Hat Luffy is out there,\Nalive and kickin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can tell the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And while you're at it,\Ntell them he's going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.78,0:22:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the King of the Pirates someday, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.05,0:22:43.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boy, have I got some news for you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:43.85,0:22:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We better print this one in a jiffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.55,0:22:47.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, baby, he's comin' back soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.71,0:22:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and when he sets sail, I wanna\Nsend him off Soul King style!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.42,0:22:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FANS gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:53.08,0:22:54.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[BROOK]\NDo you love me down to my bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.96,0:23:00.29,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\an8}[SOUL KING FANS]\N– Yeah!\N– Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.29,0:23:02.36,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NI'll dedicate this to my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:03.80,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,To my friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.80,0:23:08.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My soul will sing to you\None last time! Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.83,0:23:12.38,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NLuffy, let's go to\Nthe New World. Together.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.38,0:23:16.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The show is over! I said you're\Nunder arres... Would you shut up?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.42,0:23:20.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's his last song! Let us hear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.78,0:23:22.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, what harm could it do?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.45,0:23:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FAN J]\NShe's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.52,0:23:26.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can wait till the show\Nis over, you bastards!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:26.42,0:23:29.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NMusic is power.\NMusic is always on your side.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NOne, two, three, four.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:35.33,0:23:37.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I call this one "New World"!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.03,0:23:42.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SOUL KING FANS cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.67,0:23:47.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is Grove #46 with an update.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:47.53,0:23:49.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The pirates keep pouring in.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:49.03,0:23:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's definitely over a hundred now.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:54.20,0:23:55.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,None of the main Straw\NHats are here yet,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.80,0:23:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but even so, I would approach\Nwith extreme caution.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.73,0:24:00.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:01.10,0:24:03.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:05.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[MARINE A]\NHey! What's wrong? Did they find you?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.48,0:24:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:08.00,0:24:10.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is bad! Tell the\Nbackup they need to hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.65,0:24:13.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well now, what have we here?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:14.58,0:24:17.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this little fellow\Nwhispering behind the rock?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.08,0:24:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because he looks like a Navy soldier.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.75,0:24:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And my goodness, what is this?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.05,0:24:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You weren't looking to crash\Nour harmless party, were you?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.89,0:24:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! No! That's not very civil at all!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.41,0:24:37.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause if you were calling\Nyour friends for backup,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.87,0:24:42.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,that would not end well,\Nseeing as they weren't invited.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:42.04,0:24:43.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show some manners.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.88,0:24:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I saw him. He was calling.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.38,0:24:50.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}No! I was going to call them, but I...\NI-I hadn't gotten through to them just yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.85,0:24:52.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is good to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:52.42,0:24:54.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I say that for your sake, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.19,0:24:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.19,0:24:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because if your friends did show up,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.32,0:24:59.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,this grove would be covered in blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.72,0:25:03.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Their blood and your blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.69,0:25:06.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Coribou. Back me up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:06.29,0:25:09.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? I wasn't listening!\NI'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:09.73,0:25:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you're bowing\Nto, moron? I'm over here!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.85,0:25:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[CORIBOU yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.49,0:25:16.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive me.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.07,0:25:18.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still can't get it right!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:18.18,0:25:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What, are you blind or just stupid?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.68,0:25:23.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C]\NHe's famous for killing Marines.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.39,0:25:40.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.60,0:25:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.37,0:25:48.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.50,0:25:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aww. Do you think this is a joke?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:52.03,0:25:53.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He really stabbed that guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.59,0:25:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then the stories are true.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.20,0:25:59.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NGods, have mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.37,0:26:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is but a fool! He grabbed his gun!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.80,0:26:08.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This poor, misguided soul tried\Nto incite violence against me!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:08.52,0:26:12.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In your infinite kindness,\Nplease show him mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:12.09,0:26:16.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CORIBOU]\NSorry, gods.\NSorry. Very sorry. Sorry, gods.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:16.15,0:26:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NNow, brother, bury him.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.27,0:26:20.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bury this sinful transgressor alive.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:20.87,0:26:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dig so that his poor soul may be free.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.57,0:26:24.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CORIBOU]\NRoger!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:24.36,0:26:25.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Digging. Digging...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.72,0:26:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C]\NWait a second.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.19,0:26:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if I call them and\Ntell them not to come?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.12,0:26:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That would be good, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.06,0:26:34.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NThat's enough, Caribou.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.87,0:26:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARIBOU]\NHuh?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:36.46,0:26:39.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NYou can bury that nobody later.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.08,0:26:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We got bigger fish to fry right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.55,0:26:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.95,0:26:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just tell us what you want\Nfrom us, Captain Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.22,0:26:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're ready to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.25,0:26:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NTake a look around you, boys,\Nthis is history in the making!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:52.12,0:26:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}You probably don't know each other yet,\Nbut you'll be tight as brothers soon enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.51,0:26:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,From here on out, you're Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.38,0:27:02.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.45,0:27:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE LUFFY]\NNot a bad deal.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.72,0:27:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I swear, when I become\NKing of the Pirates,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.03,0:27:08.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you're gonna know you\Nmade the right call!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:06.53,0:27:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:08.27,0:27:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I need a promise from ya first.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.14,0:27:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause a real king needs loyal subjects,\Nones that will live and die for him
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.98,0:27:17.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and wait on him hand and foot!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.65,0:27:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.35,0:27:20.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything you say!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.85,0:27:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the man who escaped Impel Down,\Nwrecked Enies Lobby, stormed Marineford,
Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.75,0:27:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and fought the Admirals!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.59,0:27:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got the World Government\Nquaking in its boots!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.12,0:27:33.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sailing the seas with you\Nis like a dream come true!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:33.43,0:27:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's only one man\Nfit to be King of the Pirates
Dialogue: 50,0:27:36.28,0:27:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and he's standing right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.94,0:27:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You get with him, or you\Nget left in the dust!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.31,0:27:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.12,0:27:46.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE ZORO]\NLooks like the gang's all here.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.71,0:27:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIs this it?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:48.44,0:27:51.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So where is everyone?\NStop makin' me wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.04,0:27:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES cheering, laughing]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.81,0:28:00.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.01,0:28:03.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't call you here to party,\Nwe got business to attend to.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:03.81,0:28:07.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some jackasses out there haven't been\Nshowin' me the respect I deserve.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.98,0:28:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is to say, they insulted my honor!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.89,0:28:17.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A red-haired girl, a long-nosed\Nguy, and a brat with a backpack.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.22,0:28:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Find 'em and bring 'em to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:18.99,0:28:21.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The bastards are still on\Nthe archipelago somewhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.64,0:28:22.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATES yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.80,0:28:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE H]\NConsider it done, boss!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.64,0:28:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PIRATE I]\NWe'll make 'em suffer! You'll see!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.02,0:28:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, though, people sure\Ncan change a lot in two years.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:32.79,0:28:34.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For one, you guys hardly\Ntalk at all anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:35.57,0:28:37.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's more dangerous than we thought.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:37.14,0:28:40.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta get him to the boss pronto,\Nor he's gonna rat us out to everyone.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.93,0:28:42.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:42.23,0:28:46.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno, but in the meantime, let's\Ntry not to talk so he doesn't catch on.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.30,0:28:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The captain's right there, he\Ncan figure this out on his own!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.74,0:28:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.77,0:28:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dunno what happened, but it seems like\Nyou're gettin' along a lot better, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:55.68,0:28:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep. Time changes lots of stuff.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:57.75,0:28:59.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH sigh]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.45,0:29:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like your faces, I mean.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.05,0:29:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless you're wearing\Na disguise like me.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.44,0:29:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NThe Navy?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:12.47,0:29:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKKY]\NThat's right.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:13.78,0:29:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They thought those Fake Straw Hats were\Nthe real deal and mobilized their forces.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.11,0:29:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.81,0:29:22.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have them wiretapped,\Nso there's no mistaking it.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:22.91,0:29:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Brook is finishing up his concert,\Nbut I gave him a call backstage
Dialogue: 50,0:29:26.56,0:29:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,to let him know what was going on.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.12,0:29:30.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said he'd come after the\Nencore, so it shouldn't be long.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.96,0:29:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? Givin' up stardom\Nto be a lowly pirate?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.46,0:29:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goes without sayin',\Nbut the man's got a backbone.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:36.90,0:29:39.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, Nami, since\Nyou're the navigator,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.70,0:29:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there are a few tricks to operating\Na coated ship I should pass on to you.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.58,0:29:44.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh. Okay. Sure, let's hear it!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:46.63,0:29:48.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We aren't getting ready\Nto take off, are we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:48.54,0:29:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're still missing half the crew here!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:50.34,0:29:53.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I mean, did Luffy even make\Nit to the archipelago yet?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.71,0:29:55.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all under control!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:55.55,0:29:56.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FAKE SANJI]\NCaptain!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.91,0:30:00.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm kind of in the middle\Nof something, you goons!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:00.35,0:30:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we found the backpack\Nguy you was lookin' for.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:02.79,0:30:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's good, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.79,0:30:06.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a "friend of the\Ncrew," if you follow.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.12,0:30:07.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say hi.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.79,0:30:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NIn other words, Luffy\Narrived earlier this morning.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:14.20,0:30:18.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.25,0:30:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's almost time to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:19.75,0:30:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gave Sanji a baby Transponder\NSnail when he stopped by,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:22.52,0:30:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so I'll tell him to come back.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.80,0:30:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He should have Zoro with him, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.50,0:30:26.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:26.47,0:30:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We should hurry,\Nbecause any moment now,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:28.97,0:30:32.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the Navy will be attacking\Nwith a sizable force.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:32.04,0:30:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there's no way\Nto contact your captain.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.17,0:30:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you follow this Vivre card,\Nyou should be able to hunt him down.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.51,0:30:41.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hope the fake Straw\NHats buy you a bit of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.86,0:30:45.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RAYLEIGH]\NGrove 42 is on the outskirts,\Nso it's close to the sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.39,0:30:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take the Sunny there and be ready\Nto depart on a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:48.90,0:30:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'd like to relax\Nafter these two difficult years,
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.67,0:30:54.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.17,0:30:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The winds of the New\NWorld wait for no one.
